  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Strategic Partnership Agreement is between the Danish Trade Union Development Agency, Confederation of Danish Industry, and United Federation of Danish Workers. Together, they form the Danish Labour Market Consortium (LMC) which seeks to contribute to a just transition that promotes sustainable production and inclusive, gender balanced labour markets with full respect for workers&#x2019; human rights contributing to the creation of decent jobs and better opportunities in the labour markets in developing countries</narrative>
  </description>
